{"id":"vod_sn_37648","vodId":"37648","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"怪物MONSTER","name_cn":"怪物MONSTER","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6c4939fd7fab02f9077c2b02d7ef9cc7.jpg"},"summary":"供职于西德艾斯勒纪念医院的日本人天马贤三被人称作“天才医生”，他的外科技术精湛，为人谦和，受到同事的羡慕和医患的敬仰。事业上，天马前途一片光明，为院长所看好；爱情上，院长的女儿爱娃与之相恋，如胶似漆。然而看似一切美好的天马却渐渐感到良心上的不安，他亲眼目睹院方为抢救重要人物而置病危的普通人于不顾，死者家属的指责和哭泣让天马备受煎熬。当这种两难抉择再一次到来之时，天马毅然选择抢救一个头部中枪的男孩。他牺牲了自己的事业和爱情，却换来一个可怕怪物的复活。在接下来的岁月里，天马和怪物约翰展开了斗智斗勇的游戏，一段尘封的历史慢慢被揭开……　　本片根据日本漫画家浦泽直树的同名原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":74,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z6Ahj3N3ew1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GxdijNhza31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lsqkp4XbhC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FgJFvj7CyV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yp9xcqGDDc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cua52g0s1c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sPCyDEs4HM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JvD8TEdNZw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TMExPCJqig1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nhqXaSMEh51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bQQnDyMn2m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LZA2wqTiW01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TdcYf9jWdk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ULXWnQt4a41/video/index.m3u8"},{"